  "_gateComment": "A thread only becomes a row if one of the status patterns above matches somewhere in it. No acknowledgement, no rejection, no interview wording means it is not an application \u2014 a job alert, a profile notification, a newsletter. Widening the 'wait' patterns is what to do if a real application is being missed.",
